OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 16,000 people attend
OL,4,Afamily hubs in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 16,000 people attended hubs
OL,7,Faimed at supporting families in more
OL,8,Fdeprived communities over the course of
OL,9,Fa year.
OL,11,FPeterborough City Council runs five
OL,12,Ffamily hubs in Millfield, Paston,
OL,13,FWelland, East Ward and Orton Malborne,
OL,14,Fwhere parents can access advice and
OL,15,Fsupport.
OL,17,FThe authority will receive a share of
OL,18,F#500m of government funding over the
OL,19,Fnext three years to support family hubs
OL,20,Facross England.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
